# .trivyignore — the documented upstream-blocked lane of the trivy
# filesystem scan (the precedent the saddle container seat founded and
# the cargo ignore rows carry: every row below answers a finding whose
# patched line no rung can reach today, each row documenting its drop
# condition — never a silent walkaround, and the unfreeze edit retires
# a row the moment its upstream ships the patch).

